      "content": "10.1 Number System"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Data representation covers four primary number systems: Binary, Octal, Decimal, and Hexadecimal.",
        "Binary conversions involve converting numbers between Decimal, Octal, Hexadecimal, and Binary formats.",
        "ASCII stands for American Standard Code for Information Interchange.",
        "Understanding number system comparisons and conversion logic is essential for computer data representation."
